- main:
  - heading "Array.prototype.flat()" [level=1]
  - group:
    - img "Baseline Check"
    - text: Baseline Widely available
    - img "Chrome check"
    - img "Edge check"
    - img "Firefox check"
    - img "Safari check"
  - paragraph:
    - text: The
    - strong:
      - code: flat()
    - text: method of
    - link "Array":
      - /url: /en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array
      - code: Array
    - text: instances creates a new array with all sub-array elements concatenated into it recursively up to the specified depth.
